--TEST--
`prefix=` keeps the labels starting with it and `limit=` then takes the first of what is left, in that order, so the case freezes a member rather than whichever one the walk reached first — `rule:ide/a-request-line-is-closed`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Account {
    public uint $balance;
    public function credit(uint $cents): void {}
    public function close(): void {}
    public function charge(uint $cents): void {}
}
var $a = new Account();
$a-><|>
if (true) {
--REQUEST--
completion prefix=c limit=2
--EXPECT--
charge(uint $cents) method    void
close() method    void
